      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**TEXTJOIN** joins many pieces of text with the same delimiter, and can take a whole range: `=TEXTJOIN(delimiter, ignore_empty, text1, …)`. Set `ignore_empty` to `TRUE` to skip blank cells, or `FALSE` to keep them."
    },
